defensive battleship support options, chances for a unit to have a &quot;Last Stand&quot; action before death, and more. Plus, fight the imperial threat with more units on larger-scale maps than ever before. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/790820/extras/680100a323590660e1a645830a8d570c.webp?t=1763675801\" width=18 height=18 /></span> CANVAS Aesthetics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The series' signature hand-drawn visual style is back and overhauled for the newest generation. Inspired by watercolour compositions, the CANVAS Graphics Engine blends visual elements of reality and imagination to create an expressive world filled with colourful emotions. Watch the journey of Squad E unfold like an interactive painting! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/790820/extras/6b038300f816d2e17791735623b93711.webp?t=1763675801\" width=18 height=18 /></span> The Return of a Legendary Composer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The illustrious Hitoshi Sakimoto, original composer of the Valkyria Chronicles series and countless other emotional epics, returns to provide a sweeping orchestral score for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/790820/extras/2093ae270aaff40650907ae632428a4a.webp?t=1763675801\" width=18 height=18 /></span> Optimised for PC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4K resolutions, customisable keyboard and mouse controls, even ultra- widescreen support. Also includes achievements and Steam trading cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shar